=== plain-80: width 80, height 24, profile notty, dark, glyphs ascii, plain
# environment screen-alpine324-setenv --------------------------$
$
# Note$
# Mock: the Environment screen. web-01.example.net runs Alpine$
# 3.24 after setup-alpine, doas; alice is in wheel. alice ran$
# doas hardn. She did what item 1's refusal says: 20-wheel.conf$
# says permit persist setenv { HARDN_CONFIG } :wheel, and doas$
# kept /home/alice/hardn.yml. hardn has no rule for her, so the$
# screen says Not kept and item 1 refuses again.$
$
# Environment Variable Settings ################################$
$
# HARDN_CONFIG -------------------------------------------------$
$
   -  User                 alice$
  [ ] Under doas           Not kept$
   -  Value                /home/alice/hardn.yml$
$
  Select an option$
$
   1) Under doas           Keep HARDN_CONFIG$
   2) Guide                How to set HARDN_CONFIG$
$
   0) Return$
$
  > Enter selection [0-2 or q]:$
$
$

